          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-10-01">1 Oct</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">AA Argon</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">AA</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://artificialanalysis.ai/articles/claude-opus-5-5">
